[{"id":"1103192363776716800","date":1551856530000,"rawContent":"Sri Lanka's #MeToo moment has been a long time coming and maybe media is where we start it. Who wants to help me start documenting using a secure email address? #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103226521064431616","date":1551864674000,"rawContent":"Please inbox me if you\u2019re interested in helping by opening your inbox to listen to survivors and then documenting their stories if they\u2019d like that. We are going to organize using encrypted platforms so I\u2019ll need to share those details with you. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103226809041149952","date":1551864742000,"rawContent":"\u0dc4\u0dd2\u0d82\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dba\u0da7 \u0dbd\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dd9\u0da0\u0dca\u0da0 \u0d85\u0dba\u0da7 \u0dc3\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca \u0daf\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0dc0\u0d9c\u0dda\u0db8 \u0d92\u0d9c\u0ddc\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd\u0ddc \u0d9a\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0d91\u0dba\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd9 \u0d9a\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbd \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0d8b\u0daf\u0dc0\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0d9a\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0da7 msg \u0d91\u0d9a\u0d9a\u0dca \u0d91\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1. #MeToo\u2060 \u2060 #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103248099730894848","date":1551869818000,"rawContent":"@incs66 And no illusions that this will be the be all and end all of conversations about sexual harassment and VAW in the country. Just one of many conversations that can form a moment in the country. #MeToo has a lot of limitations, esp in how it relates to this part of the world \ud83e\udd37\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u2640\ufe0f","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103520139872428033","date":1551934678000,"rawContent":"We\u2019ve got a group of volunteers ready to get started but we still need more people who can read and write in Tamil so please spread the word. Sharing below some of our intentions for more clarity. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103520144171556866","date":1551934679000,"rawContent":"Why are we doing this?\n\nFirstly it\u2019s to make survivors of sexual harassment and violence feel less alone by creating safe spaces for them to be heard. So we plan to listen and offer empathy and solidarity. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103520146532925441","date":1551934680000,"rawContent":"Secondly it\u2019s to connect survivors to support services, regardless of whether they are ready to tell us their story. So we plan to share with them our trusted counsellors and lawyers. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103520148403544065","date":1551934680000,"rawContent":"Thirdly it\u2019s to challenge the impunity enjoyed by those who harass and abuse. We will ask the survivors if they want to name their abusers (the survivor can remain anon should they choose) and if they say yes, work with them accordingly. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103621408091922433","date":1551958822000,"rawContent":"I believe you. I\u2019m here for you. Are you a woman who has faced or is facing sexual harassment and\/or violence? You\u2019re not alone. My inbox is open and safe. I can listen and if you like, help document your story on a public list (you can be anonymous). #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103621409467559936","date":1551958822000,"rawContent":"If you\u2019re not ready to share your story but need legal or counseling services, please feel free to ask me for a list of trusted lawyers and counsellors you can talk to. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103622040865533952","date":1551958973000,"rawContent":"\u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0dc0\u0dd4\u0db1 \u0dc4\u0ddd \u0dc0\u0dd9\u0db1 \u0daf\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0db1 \u0d9a\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0dd1\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0db1\u0dd0\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dad\u0dca \u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dba \u0dc4\u0ddd \u0d8b\u0db4\u0daf\u0dda\u0dc1\u0db1 \u0dc3\u0dda\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d9c\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc1\u0dca\u0dba \u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0da7 \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1. \u0d85\u0db4\u0dd2 \u0d9c\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dca\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dd3 \u0dc3\u0dda\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0dd0\u0dba\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dc0. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1103622039175217152","date":1551958973000,"rawContent":"\u0db8\u0d82 \u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dca\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dc3 \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dc0. \u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf \u0dad\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd3 \u0db1\u0dd1. \u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0dd2\u0d82\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0d85\u0dad\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dba\u0d9a\u0da7 \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dd9\u0dbd\u0dcf \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dc0\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc4\u0ddd \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dd9\u0db8\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0d89\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0dc0 \u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0da7 inbox \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1. \u0db8\u0db8 \u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf\u0d9c\u0dda \u0d9a\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0d85\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca. \u0d8a\u0da7 \u0db4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dd9 \u0d85\u0db4\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0d9a\u0dba\u0dcf\u0d9c\u0dda \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dbb \u0db4\u0ddc\u0daf\u0dd4 \u0daf\u0dad\u0dca\u0dad\u0d9c\u0db6\u0da9\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0da7 \u0daf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0d94\u0dba\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0d92\u0d9a \u0d86\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dc0 \u0dc3\u0dc4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dca\u0db1\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dc0 \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 \u0d8b\u0daf\u0dc0\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca. #MeToo #MeTooSriLanka #lka","media":null,"username":"sachp","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter